Hey Eric,

I really appreciate you spending the time going through my code and getting it to work. I will go through it myself within the next few days, but it sounds like you’ve got me a step closer to my goal. Thank you for that.

Yes, I realised that dsims​ currently does not have the functionality needed to answer my extrapolation questions. I might have to look into modifying or writing my own function to get at least some indication of if and when an extrapolation approach would be feasible.

Thanks again,
Leonard

On Saturday, November 23rd, 2024 at 04:41, 'Eric Rexstad' via distance-sampling <distance...@googlegroups.com> wrote:

